# The Neon tileset writes two pictures for inspection -- a mock map and a
# filmstrip of the colour cycle.  They live beside the source art rather than
# beside the sheet, because Makefile.osx copies lib/tiles wholesale into the
# app bundle and these have no business shipping.
scripts/tiles/neon/preview.png
scripts/tiles/neon/preview-actual-size.png
scripts/tiles/neon/cycle.png
